mory metrics are normal\n\n## Diagnosis\n\nThis run exhibits **auxiliary_feature_leakage**: the enabled auxiliary feature acts as a direct label correlate that artificially inflates model performance beyond the healthy range. The fix is to disable the auxiliary feature.",
